#: ../../source/contribution.rst:207
msgid "**Auto Generation of API Docs:**"
msgstr "**自动生成 API 文档：**"

#: ../../source/contribution.rst:209
msgid ""
"We utilize a python script to generate/refresh all API docs rst files "
"under /docs/source/api based on the codebase /tensorcircuit."
msgstr ""
"我们利用 python 脚本根据代码库 /tensorcircuit 生成/刷新 /docs/source/api 下的所有 API rst "
"文档文件。"

#: ../../source/contribution.rst:216
msgid "**Paper Reproduction Gallery:**"
msgstr "**论文复现画廊：**"

#: ../../source/contribution.rst:218
msgid ""
"The static gallery served at ``/reproduce/`` is generated from the "
"``meta.yaml`` files of git-tracked reproductions under "
"``examples/reproduce_papers``. Regenerate and commit it whenever a "
"reproduction is added or its metadata changes. The generator validates "
"every entry against ``examples/reproduce_papers/taxonomy.yaml`` and "
"aborts on unknown tags, undeclared figures, or missing files, and its "
"output is deterministic, so a rerun without data changes leaves no diff."
msgstr ""
"``/reproduce/`` 提供的静态画廊由 ``examples/reproduce_papers`` 下受 git 跟踪的复现项的 "
"``meta.yaml`` 文件生成。每当新增复现项或其元数据发生变化时，请重新生成并提交。生成器会依据 "
"``examples/reproduce_papers/taxonomy.yaml`` "
"校验每一项，并在遇到未知标签、未声明的图或缺失文件时中止；其输出是确定性的，因此在数据未变时重新运行不会产生差异。"

#: ../../source/contribution.rst:229
msgid "**i18n:**"
msgstr "**国际化**"

#: ../../source/contribution.rst:231
msgid ""
"For Chinese docs, we refer to the standard i18n workflow provided by "
"sphinx, see `here <https://www.sphinx-"
"doc.org/en/master/usage/advanced/intl.html>`__."
msgstr ""
"对于中文文档，我们参考 sphinx 提供的标准国际化工作流，请参见 `这里 <https://www.sphinx-"
"doc.org/en/master/usage/advanced/intl.html>`__ 。"

#: ../../source/contribution.rst:233
msgid "To update the po file from updated English rst files, using"
msgstr "为从更新的英文 rst 文件中更新 .po 文件，使用"

#: ../../source/contribution.rst:242
msgid ""
"Edit these .po files to add translations (`poedit "
"<https://poedit.net/>`__ recommended). These files are in "
"docs/source/locale/zh/LC_MESSAGES."
msgstr ""
"编辑这些 .po 文件来添加翻译（推荐使用 `poedit <https://poedit.net/>`__ ）。这些文件位于 "
"docs/source/locale/zh/LC_MESSAGES。"

#: ../../source/contribution.rst:244
msgid ""
"To generate the Chinese version of the documentation: ``sphinx-build "
"source -D language=\"zh\" build/html_cn`` which is in the separate "
"directory ``.../build/html_cn/index.html``, whereas English version is in"
" the directory ``.../build/html/index.html``."
msgstr ""
"生成中文版文档：``sphinx-build source -D language=\"zh\" "
"build/html_cn``，生成结果位于独立目录 ``.../build/html_cn/index.html``，而英文版位于 "
"``.../build/html/index.html``。"

#: ../../source/contribution.rst:248
msgid "Releases"
msgstr "发布"

#: ../../source/contribution.rst:251
msgid "Stable release"
msgstr "正式版发布"

#: ../../source/contribution.rst:253
msgid ""
"Bump ``__version__`` in ``tensorcircuit/__init__.py``. Add a ``## vX.Y.Z`` "
"heading immediately below ``## Unreleased`` in ``CHANGELOG.md`` so the "
"accumulated entries belong to the new version."
msgstr ""
"更新 ``tensorcircuit/__init__.py`` 中的 ``__version__``。在 ``CHANGELOG.md`` "
"的 ``## Unreleased`` 下方紧接着添加 ``## vX.Y.Z`` 标题，将积累的条目归入新版本。"

#: ../../source/contribution.rst:254
msgid ""
"Review the version bump, then commit it and push it to ``master`` on the "
"official repository. Wait for the ``ci`` run triggered by that branch push "
"to pass for the release commit SHA."
msgstr ""
"核对版本改动后提交，并推送到官方仓库的 ``master`` 分支。确认这次分支推送触发的 "
"``ci`` 已在发布提交对应的 SHA 上通过。"

#: ../../source/contribution.rst:255
msgid ""
"Create a signed ``vX.Y.Z`` tag pointing to the commit that passed CI and "
"push the tag. Substitute the release version, commit SHA, and the name of "
"your remote for the official repository in these commands."
msgstr ""
"为通过 CI 的提交创建签名 tag ``vX.Y.Z`` 并推送。执行命令前，替换其中的版本号、"
"提交 SHA 和指向官方仓库的远程名称。"

#: ../../source/contribution.rst:262
msgid ""
"Wait for the tag-triggered ``release`` workflow to pass, then verify that "
"the wheel and source distribution appear for the new version on PyPI. This "
"workflow checks that the tag matches ``__version__`` and publishes "
"``tensorcircuit-ng`` via trusted publishing. The tag push also starts a "
"separate ``ci`` run for the same commit."
msgstr ""
"等待 tag 触发的 ``release`` 工作流通过，再确认新版本的 wheel 和源码包均已出现在 "
"PyPI 上。此工作流检查 tag 与 ``__version__`` 是否一致，并通过 Trusted Publishing "
"发布 ``tensorcircuit-ng``。推送 tag 还会为同一提交触发另一轮独立的 ``ci``。"

#: ../../source/contribution.rst:263
msgid ""
"Draft the release notes using the format below, then publish the GitHub "
"release from the existing tag. With the GitHub CLI, save the notes to "
"``release-notes.md`` and use the following command."
msgstr ""
"按下文格式起草发布说明，再用已有的 tag 发布 GitHub Release。使用 GitHub CLI 时，"
"将发布说明保存到 ``release-notes.md`` 后执行以下命令。"

#: ../../source/contribution.rst:271
msgid "GitHub release notes"
msgstr "GitHub 发布说明"

#: ../../source/contribution.rst:273
msgid ""
"Set the title to the tag alone, such as ``v1.11.0``. Start the body directly "
"with a few short highlights."
msgstr "标题只写 tag，例如 ``v1.11.0``。正文直接以几条简短的亮点开头。"

#: ../../source/contribution.rst:274
msgid ""
"Lead with the most important user-facing changes and explain what they "
"enable. Group related features and summarize the remaining performance and "
"correctness improvements in one bullet. Mention specific APIs when they help "
"readers use the feature."
msgstr ""
"优先写用户最能感受到的变化，并说明它们能用来做什么。把相关功能归在一起，其余性能改进"
"和正确性修复合为一条。具体 API 能帮助读者使用功能时，再写出 API 名称。"

#: ../../source/contribution.rst:275
msgid ""
"Close the highlights with a single link to the changelog section at the "
"release tag for the full list and migration details."
msgstr "亮点之后只附该 tag 对应的 changelog 章节链接，供读者查阅完整变更和迁移说明。"

#: ../../source/contribution.rst:276
msgid ""
"End with an ``Acknowledgments`` heading and @mention each human contributor "
"other than the maintainer publishing the release. Between the previous and "
"new tags, check commit authors, co-authors, and merged pull request authors. "
"Use each contributor's GitHub handle once."
msgstr ""
"以 ``Acknowledgments`` 小节收尾，@ 每位参与贡献的真人，发布人除外。核对上一个 tag "
"到新 tag 之间的提交作者、共同作者和已合并 PR 的作者。每位贡献者的 GitHub 用户名只写一次。"

#: ../../source/contribution.rst:278
msgid ""
"See the `v1.11.0 release notes <https://github.com/tensorcircuit/tensorcircuit-ng/releases/tag/v1.11.0>`_ "
"for an example."
msgstr ""
"可参考 `v1.11.0 发布说明 <https://github.com/tensorcircuit/tensorcircuit-ng/releases/tag/v1.11.0>`_。"

#: ../../source/contribution.rst:281
msgid "Nightly and manual PyPI releases"
msgstr "Nightly 和手动 PyPI 发布"

#: ../../source/contribution.rst:283
msgid ""
"The ``nightly`` workflow builds ``master`` daily and publishes it as "
"``tensorcircuit-nightly``. Its schedule is set in "
"``.github/workflows/nightly_release.yml``."
msgstr ""
"``nightly`` 工作流每天构建 ``master`` 并发布为 ``tensorcircuit-nightly``。"
"触发时间在 ``.github/workflows/nightly_release.yml`` 中配置。"

#: ../../source/contribution.rst:285
msgid ""
"For a manual PyPI upload, build from the release commit and upload the wheel "
"and source distribution."
msgstr "手动上传至 PyPI 时，从发布提交构建并上传 wheel 和源码包。"

#: ../../source/contribution.rst:295
msgid "DockerHub Release"
msgstr "DockerHub 发布"

#: ../../source/contribution.rst:297
msgid "Make sure the DockerHub account is logged in via ``docker login``."
msgstr "确保已通过 ``docker login`` 登录 DockerHub 账户。"

#: ../../source/contribution.rst:308
msgid "Binder Release"
msgstr "Binder 发布"

#: ../../source/contribution.rst:310
msgid ""
"One may need to update the tensorcircuit version for binder environment "
"by pushing new commit in refraction-ray/tc-env repo with new version "
"update in its ``requirements.txt``. See `mybind setup "
"<https://discourse.jupyter.org/t/tip-speed-up-binder-launches-by-pulling-"
"github-content-in-a-binder-link-with-nbgitpuller/922>`_ for speed up via "
"nbgitpuller."
msgstr ""
"可能需要通过在 refraction-ray/tc-env 仓库中推送新提交，并在其 ``requirements.txt`` "
"中更新新版本，来更新 binder 环境的 tensorcircuit 版本。参见 `mybind 设置 "
"<https://discourse.jupyter.org/t/tip-speed-up-binder-launches-by-pulling-"
"github-content-in-a-binder-link-with-nbgitpuller/922>`_ ，了解如何通过 "
"nbgitpuller 加速。"

